| Code | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `c1` | No rewards on fuel spends |
| `c2` | No rewards on wallet loads |
| `c3` | No rewards on rent payments |
| `c4` | No rewards on government or utility payments |
| `c5` | Unlimited lounge access |
| `c6` | Domestic lounge access only |
| `c7` | Reward redemption attracts GST |
| `c8` | Foreign markup applies |
| `c9` | Priority Pass included |
| `c10` | Reward points expire after a fixed period |
| `c11` | Fees vary by variant |
| `c12` | Excludes insurance premium spends |
| `c13` | Excludes educational payments |
| `c14` | Excludes EMI transactions |
| `c15` | Excludes cash-equivalent spends |
| `c16` | Reward capped per statement cycle ← NEW |
| `c17` | Co-brand merchant exclusive (e.g., Swiggy/Flipkart only) ← NEW |
| `c18` | Network exclusive benefit (Visa/MC-only) ← NEW |
| `c19` | High income criteria applies ← NEW |
| `c20` | Card discontinued for new applicants ← NEW |
| `c21` | UPI transactions earn rewards (RuPay-on-UPI cards) ← NEW |
| `c22` | Prepaid/credit-line hybrid product ← NEW |
| `c23` | Spa/wellness benefits available ← NEW |
| `c24` | BOGO offers via specific partners ← NEW |
| `c25` | Issued via NBFC / partner-bank ← NEW |

#### 14. Card-type to flag mapping
- For discontinued cards: include `"fl":"discontinued"` and set `cf:"l"`, also add caveat `c20`.

#### 15. Extraction logic (unchanged)
1. Filter by `b` (bank)
2. Filter by `g[].n` (group)
3. Filter by `c[].n` (card name)
4. Resolve inheritance: combine parent `p`/`m` with child
5. Apply `x` exclusions
6. Apply `md` modifications
7. Resolve BIN: match against first digits

